715→@P.y += sin(t * 2) * 0.5;
716→```
717→Creates an animated wave effect by calculating a time offset based on distance from origin, then uses that offset to animate both the up vector (rotating around Y axis) and the Y position (vertical oscillation). The Y position uses a doubled frequency and is scaled by 0.5 to constrain movement between -0.5 and +0.5 units, creating a bouncing motion that propagates outward.
