726→This snippet demonstrates animating both vector orientation and position using time-based sine waves. It creates a time variable offset by a channel parameter, uses it to animate an 'up' vector in the XZ plane via sin/cos, and simultaneously offsets points vertically with a doubled frequency sine wave.
